Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.94,0:00:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, passage in for a\Nthoughtful program. What
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.66,0:01:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tokomon get in a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.28,0:01:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I played with them instead,\Nbut I still miss the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.84,0:01:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Todd finally found me, I was so happy\Nthat me and Tokomon made friends again,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.68,0:01:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which made DemiDevimon kind of scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.16,0:02:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He tried to make us eat these mushrooms\Nthat would make me forget about Toko.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.74,0:02:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Ogilmon stopped me just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.32,0:02:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when Patamon boom-bubbled!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.10,0:02:15.11,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}You're My Friend! WereGarurumon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.46,0:02:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomoyo Wa-Garulmon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where are we matt don't\Ntell me we're lost again
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay i won't but just take\Na look at that ridge up
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.38,0:02:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there where hey other\Ndigimon i say we follow them
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.64,0:02:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wherever they're going and\Nhope they're not lost too
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.94,0:02:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now that's weird a restaurant\Nin the middle of nowhere
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.00,0:02:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the perfect location for\Nhungry digimon the usual
