Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.10,0:02:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meet Vegiemon, the maniacal\Nmanager of a run-down cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.84,0:02:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He puts a new spin on\Nthe term slave driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Busboy, go get some new customers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:02:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.50,0:02:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Mammon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:02:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.90,0:02:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.81,0:03:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon and Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Joe Everett gonna be happy to see
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.38,0:03:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you two. Hey, Matt. Hey, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where you been and what\Nare you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.88,0:03:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.72,0:03:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You left, and then Mimi and\NIzzy, they both disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.70,0:03:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then TK and I were left alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.84,0:03:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it started when we all went\Nour separate ways to look for Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.66,0:03:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.48,0:03:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I definitely knew where I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I just didn't know\Nexactly where I was, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.50,0:03:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lost, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.80,0:03:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.71,0:03:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you sneak up on me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.98,0:03:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Just a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.82,0:03:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd like to know I saw\Nsome other humans just like you nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.68,0:03:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say you saw my friends?\NWhich way? This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.16,0:03:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we gotta hurry before we\Nlose him I was sure he was
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.42,0:03:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leading us the wrong way But\Nwho was I to question him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.60,0:03:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like I knew my way around
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.84,0:03:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eventually,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.75,0:03:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we ended up at this restaurant Which the\Ntime was good Because we were starving
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, I wish my mom cooked that good\NDelicious And now, the bill Oh, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this should be enough What are you,\Nsome kind of comedian, pal? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you go, Vegiemon
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.16,0:04:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dollar bills?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.07,0:04:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.94,0:04:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, I was, um, all\NI have are digi-dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.06,0:04:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some play money is all you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what I'm hearing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you actually thought I\Nlet you eat without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.06,0:04:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now he's making you cook\Nthe food to pay him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'm not doing dishes\Nor scrubbing toilets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.70,0:04:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.61,0:04:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to say pretty please?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.74,0:04:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, quit yelling or you'll\Nmake me spill all over my pants
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.08,0:04:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, about time. Who are these jokers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.68,0:04:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're friends of Joe and Gomamon\NWell, whoop-dee-doo and good for you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.26,0:04:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.17,0:04:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't give that to my customers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.00,0:04:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, but, but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:05:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you'll work an extra day for the\Ningredients you wasted Another day?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.10,0:05:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more day?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.34,0:05:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On top of how long, Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.82,0:05:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, first,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.98,0:05:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you see, it was only supposed\Nto be for three days,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.96,0:05:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I kept on making\Nmistakes, and it got longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.22,0:05:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm up to over six weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.16,0:05:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he still owes me for all the wasted\Nfood, not to mention the broken dishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.72,0:05:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all the commotion in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.48,0:05:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The customers are complaining.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.42,0:05:28.89,Sign,,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Digitamamon
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.42,0:05:28.89,Sign,,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.42,0:05:28.89,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.42,0:05:28.89,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.42,0:05:28.89,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.42,0:05:28.89,Sign,,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
