Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.58,0:05:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't know it yet, but\NDigitamamon was an evil Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.42,0:05:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fully evolved and protected\Nby his Digi-eggshell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, are you the restaurant owner?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.70,0:05:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friend's been working like\Ncrazy to pay off one lousy meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.80,0:05:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't he go now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.71,0:05:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.88,0:05:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.76,0:05:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, if you stay and work\Nwith him to pay off the debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.24,0:05:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.15,0:05:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want help, then just go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're no use to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.70,0:05:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm allergic to kitchen work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.34,0:05:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.86,0:05:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, just never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I've got to go and find TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.56,0:05:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But after I do, we'll come back here\Nand help you work off your debt, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.90,0:06:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really? You will?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.70,0:06:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what friends do, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.10,0:06:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When things are tough,\Nthey help each other out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.74,0:06:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll always remember this, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.56,0:06:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DemiDevimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.54,0:06:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it you have another\Njob for me to do. The new boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.62,0:06:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mustn't let him leave here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.30,0:06:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.24,0:06:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I checked the schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.64,0:06:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Schedule?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.55,0:06:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The word schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.47,0:06:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get inside and start\Ncooking or you're fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.00,0:06:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I quit. How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.32,0:06:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say you stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the big deal, egghead?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.52,0:06:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.54,0:06:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, you already got a\Nslave working in your kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.58,0:06:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.66,0:06:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you don't care what happens\Nto your friend while you're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.88,0:06:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Selfish, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.20,0:06:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.72,0:06:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.80,0:06:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while you're away, there's no telling what\Nmight happen to your poor little friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.30,0:06:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many accidents can happen\Nin the kitchen, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.10,0:06:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.18,0:07:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.20,0:07:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's already cracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.30,0:07:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.92,0:07:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This water's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.80,0:07:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had some rubber gloves, my\Nfingers wouldn't get all wrinkled.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.24,0:07:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, hey, just what are\Nyou making over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.00,0:07:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there some reason\Nyou're not talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.14,0:07:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I know you think I can be\Nirritating sometimes, but what gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.76,0:07:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.70,0:07:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many accidents can\Nhappen in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.72,0:07:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So many accidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i can't leave him did you hear me earth\Nto matt come in matt although he does talk
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.72,0:07:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a lot weren't you gonna go get tk if you\Nwant to leave it's okay i decided not to go
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.36,0:07:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey wow i'm sorry if i said\Nsomething that made you mad
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.12,0:07:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I can't believe what\Na jerk I'm being, Josh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.14,0:07:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is trying to be nice\Nand i bite off his head
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.58,0:07:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey i'm sorry uh-huh i didn't mean to yell
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:08:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at you okay i guess i\Nwas just thinking about
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.30,0:08:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something else oh yeah\Nanyways i'm a really
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.40,0:08:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,good cook everything will\Ngo a lot faster if we
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.00,0:08:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,work together and we'll\Nbe out of here in no
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.92,0:08:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time all right i guess\Nthat sounds like a plan
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i make a mean pb and\Njay you know and i'm an
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.00,0:08:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,expert at boiling water\Nall right then we can do
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.72,0:08:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.63,0:08:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.55,0:08:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta solve this first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.60,0:08:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clumsy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.51,0:08:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll cost you three\Nmore days! Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.12,0:08:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.42,0:08:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,another week!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.33,0:08:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrong, wrong, wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.40,0:08:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll cost you ten more days!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.02,0:08:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, oh boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.04,0:08:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand why\NI'm so accident prone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.76,0:08:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so maybe balancing plates on a platter\Nisn't one of my natural skills, but now
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.28,0:08:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it seems worse than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.20,0:08:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Matt. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.94,0:08:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.12,0:08:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why am I talking to myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.22,0:08:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even worse, why am I\Nlistening and talking back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.48,0:08:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to do something
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.44,0:09:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to snap out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.54,0:09:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That did it. I snapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.42,0:09:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.62,0:09:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.76,0:09:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Half of what i cook ends up on the\Nfloor and the other half is on his
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,clothes this job is giving me a killer\Nheadache tell me this is all just
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.74,0:09:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a bad dream everything's going\Nperfectly those two will be slaving in
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.54,0:09:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that kitchen for life looks like a\Nlikely spot for another little accident
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.32,0:09:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bring me some potatoes will you\Njoe all right coming right up
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.42,0:09:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those potatoes falling will\Ncost them another month of work
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.62,0:09:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think it'll work?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet, Beaumont
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.06,0:09:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.54,0:09:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing happened But how could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.66,0:10:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like my dirty tricks\Nwill have to be even dirtier
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.68,0:10:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a beautiful sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.20,0:10:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.11,0:10:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.03,0:10:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just passing by when I\Nheard the sound of your music.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.84,0:10:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.90,0:10:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a bad Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.16,0:10:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have good hearing, and it sounds\Nas if you're worried about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.58,0:10:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.49,0:10:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.41,0:10:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A musical instrument often reflects the\Nfeelings of the person who's playing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.54,0:10:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your music sounds sad, so I figure\Nthat you're sad about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.76,0:11:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if you're hurting\Nyourself to help out a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.04,0:11:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how would you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.06,0:11:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well it's obvious what's happening at the\Nrestaurant i see what your friend is up to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.60,0:11:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what are you talking about i think he's
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.02,0:11:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,making all those mistakes\Non purpose he can't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.90,0:11:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be just so you won't leave him there alone
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.14,0:11:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not him joe just wouldn't\Ndo that to me you're
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.20,0:11:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a nice guy but remember nice guys wind up\Nwashing dishes for the rest of their lives
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.38,0:11:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.42,0:11:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or could it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.64,0:11:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I promise you\NI'll come right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.08,0:11:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just have to let me go\Nand get my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.26,0:11:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.90,0:11:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, it's really important. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get cooking before the\Ncustomers start complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.02,0:12:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not more plates that's another week for the\Nboth of you what are you talking about i
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.84,0:12:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't stay here another week i've got places\Nto go you'll stay all right and no tips
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.74,0:12:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh joe why are you doing this huh you think\Ni'm doing this on purpose you think i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.82,0:12:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,juggling plates while\Ni wash them something
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tripped me quit making up excuses i'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.16,0:12:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've got to believe me matt
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.96,0:12:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's that sound my digivice is going\Noff again then our friends are nearby it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.18,0:12:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did the same thing when we found tk maybe\Nwe'll find my brother and maybe some food
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.80,0:12:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gomamon Gomamon tk and Tai if you're\Nhere then my brother must be here too
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and joe's here too right pal yeah he's\Nhere but what's wrong joe can tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.66,0:12:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about it joe Tai i'm so glad to see\Nyou guys but don't break anything sure
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.22,0:13:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but what are you doing here hey joe\Nit's great to see you but Where's Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.10,0:13:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, Matt's around back. Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.40,0:13:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.00,0:13:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiya, Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.12,0:13:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.34,0:13:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.36,0:13:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.98,0:13:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm great now that we're together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.18,0:13:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where's Tai? Hey, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.46,0:13:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.80,0:13:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, seems like something\Nweird's going on around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.52,0:13:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you could say we got ourselves\Ninto some hot water Oh, a cooking joke
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.48,0:13:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry I didn't come back\Nand keep my promise to get you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK That's all right, I'm sure you\Nwould have if you could have, Matt
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.70,0:13:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, you're here and\Nthat's what counts No,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.82,0:13:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what counts is that we get out of\Nthis weirdo place and quick What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.56,0:13:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.47,0:13:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course run away I don't\Nsee any guards around here
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.66,0:13:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to Huh? Well, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.86,0:14:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave when I'm ready. Anyway, I\Nam not going anywhere with Joe. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.80,0:14:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't want to work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.36,0:14:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He only cares about himself. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you say that, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all friends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, what friends? Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you mean this guy who\Ndeliberately wrecks everything
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.30,0:14:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to keep me here cooking rice\Nuntil I'm an old geezer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.30,0:14:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.02,0:14:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what about you, big shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.70,0:14:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one who got us all separated?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, stop yelling!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.12,0:14:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you glad you all have friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.03,0:14:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be quiet, TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.14,0:14:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.05,0:14:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just be quiet and come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.26,0:14:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will, will, will You weren't planning\Non running away, now, were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.38,0:14:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would make me very angry
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.70,0:14:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that would be a very bad idea
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.58,0:14:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.00,0:14:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DemiDevimon! It's the evil\NDigimon we met before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.66,0:14:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lied You lied to me to get me to\Ncome here And you're the one that's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.44,0:14:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wrecking everything So we're gonna\Nteach you a good lesson Pepper breath,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,point Boom, bubble, pop
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.38,0:14:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.52,0:15:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's hot! After him, guys! How\Ndishonest, trying to leave without
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.98,0:15:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,paying me you're a thief we've\Nworked here long enough to pay for a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.98,0:15:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trip to Hawaii? Why is not on the\Nschedule, but if you insist, I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.68,0:15:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,send you to the moon you wanna leave\Nyou'll You have to beat me first!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.22,0:15:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.84,0:15:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.75,0:15:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.12,0:15:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.68,0:15:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.06,0:15:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doom Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.82,0:15:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.98,0:15:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His shell is closed, so\Nthe blast has no effect!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very perceptive of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.56,0:15:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.32,0:15:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha! Call off, you beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.32,0:15:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.52,0:15:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your little brother\Ndecided to hang around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.28,0:15:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody get me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.30,0:15:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's going too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.94,0:15:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.72,0:16:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gomamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.63,0:16:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higgyball, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.20,0:16:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higgyball!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.06,0:16:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, back off for a ball\Nto the kids' lunch bait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.58,0:16:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.04,0:16:14.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.36,0:16:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe! He's caught! Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.34,0:16:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You always said that we would all have\Nto work together to get out of this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.40,0:16:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, it looks like my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.38,0:16:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, we gotta help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.10,0:16:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, Ikkakumon. Blast him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.22,0:16:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, tell your friend I'm a\Nvery short-tempered Vansymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.76,0:16:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it, Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.14,0:16:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you've got to attack while I\Nkeep him busy. Attack! I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.26,0:16:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.72,0:16:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After I accused him in Yeoman,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he still risked himself for TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.28,0:17:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.50,0:17:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.20,0:17:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you two don't know when to quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.88,0:17:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy you both with one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nightmare syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.94,0:17:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.82,0:17:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.32,0:17:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.04,0:17:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to beat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't beat them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.20,0:17:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need Tai, TK, Sora, Izzy, Mimi, and Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.80,0:17:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together, we're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.44,0:17:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we can beat anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.24,0:17:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crest of friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.86,0:18:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.90,0:18:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.68,0:18:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultimate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.88,0:18:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Garurumon?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.12,0:18:33.09,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}WereGarurumon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.12,0:18:33.09,Sign,,370,0,130,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.12,0:18:33.09,Sign,,370,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.12,0:18:33.09,Sign,,370,0,225,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Beast Man Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.12,0:18:33.09,Sign,,370,0,305,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.12,0:18:33.09,Sign,,370,0,345,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Kaiser Nail
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.32,0:18:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where Garurumon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ultimate form of Garurumon, is a\Nreally fierce warrior with claws,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strong kicks, and jumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.94,0:18:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's extreme, but Egghead and his\Nlittle bat buddy leave him no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.22,0:18:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming up, one scrambled egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.32,0:18:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and your little\Ndoggy don't frighten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.86,0:18:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.08,0:18:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was just the beginning,\Nyou little poacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.18,0:18:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They beat Digitamamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.46,0:19:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye, aye, time for me to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.00,0:19:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.56,0:19:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegiemon, you better let go of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.06,0:19:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to be silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.16,0:19:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that was so cool, Nat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.74,0:19:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the awesomest big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.08,0:19:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta hand it to you, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was really brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.24,0:19:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I did was get grabbed\Nby a giant vegetable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.66,0:19:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cranky one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.18,0:19:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Joe? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.92,0:19:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really proud of how\Nyou handled this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.16,0:19:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At my old school, they voted\Nme most likely to chicken out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.16,0:19:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we showed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.30,0:19:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also need to apologize. Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.20,0:19:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh... Why, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.26,0:19:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.38,0:19:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never should have doubted you, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.52,0:19:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Otis-mon, one of the humans got the\NCrest of Friendship to glow and gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.44,0:19:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,WereGarurumon! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.68,0:19:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.40,0:19:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps your brain is\Ntoo small for this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.02,0:20:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You rotten kitten, you rotten\NDigimon, you'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.90,0:20:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So everything is linked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.38,0:20:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't fix things here, then\Nour world will be in trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.66,0:20:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going off again. It seems\Nlike every time this happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.08,0:20:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we find one of our friends So there must\Nbe someone around here But which direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.08,0:20:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, mine's pointing out there\NMine says they're off this way
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.88,0:20:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess if we want to find them,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.68,0:20:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're just going to have to split up\Nagain Yeah, I think you're right TK,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.74,0:20:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you hang with me Cool, and Joe will\Ncome with me Just so nobody gets lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.02,0:20:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's meet at the foot\Nof that mountain, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.10,0:20:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a plan
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.34,0:20:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, do you really\Nthink we'll meet again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.78,0:20:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.69,0:20:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guarantee it. Farewell.\NBye-bye. Auf Wiedersehen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.06,0:20:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't go yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.08,0:20:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to tie my shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, you're ruining our big dramatic exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.76,0:21:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I put it on the day,\NI can't see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.60,0:21:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.76,0:21:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish. Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.48,0:21:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me, I'm just right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.14,0:21:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.18,0:21:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can see it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.36,0:21:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's a jacket. It's a jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.34,0:21:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and a jacket It's a dream that
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.80,0:21:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can see. It's a dream that
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.52,0:21:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can see. The sun will shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.78,0:22:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.49,0:23:04.45,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Crush! AtlurKabuterimon

